OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy with
OL,6,Fshowers or longer spells of rain in
OL,7,Fthe evening. Becoming generally drier
OL,8,Fovernight but still cloudy with a few
OL,9,Flight showers. Breezy around the
OL,10,FBuchan coasts.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FCool and mostly cloudy through
OL,13,Fthe day. A few light showers in the
OL,14,Fmorning then becoming dry through the
OL,15,Fafternoon.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FMainly
OL,18,Fdry although rather cloudy at times
OL,19,Fover the weekend. Dry with more in the
OL,20,Fway of sunshine on Monday.
